{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54219","headline":"颂 二 · 慧光","name":"颂 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"修多妙用勿（《五灯会元》作「好句枉」）功夫，返本还源是大愚。\n古（《五灯会元》作「祖」）佛不从修证得，直饶玄妙（《五灯会元》作「纵行玄路」）也崎岖。\n（《祖堂集》卷九、《五灯会元》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}